3, about to order more.`},{name:`Jessica N.`,stars:4,text:`Got Office 2021 Pro Plus. Took about 4 minutes to receive the key. Activation was smooth. One star off because the download took forever but that is my internet lol.`},{name:`Brian O.`,stars:5,text:`Was worried about buying cheap Windows keys online. Read all the reviews, took a chance. Best decision. Key was genuine, Microsoft support even helped me with activation.`},{name:`Lauren F.`,stars:5,text:`Needed a last minute Windows key for a client presentation. These guys delivered in literally 3 minutes. Client was impressed. I looked like a hero. Will use forever.`},{name:`Mark D.`,stars:5,text:`Third purchase from KeyStarter. Never had a single bad key. Their consistency is what keeps me coming back. Win 10, Win 11, Office - all worked perfectly.`},{name:`Tiffany G.`,stars:5,text:`I do not usually write reviews but this deserves one. Saved 150 on Office. The key arrived fast, activated instantly. My accountant brain is very happy with the savings.`},{name:`Ryan S.`,stars:4,text:`Good value overall. Win 10 Pro OEM key worked fine. Delivery took closer to 8 minutes instead of the promised 2-5 but that is still pretty fast. Would buy again.`},{name:`Nicole B.`,stars:5,text:`My son built his first PC and needed Windows. Found KeyStarter through Reddit. Cannot believe we almost paid 199 at Best Buy. This was 18 and worked exactly the same.`},{name:`Steve M.`,stars:5,text:`Sysadmin for a mid-size company. Purchased 20+ IoT Enterprise LTSC licenses for our kiosk deployment. All keys validated. The sticker delivery option is great for compliance.`},{name:`Ashley T.`,stars:5,text:`I manage a coworking space. We go through Windows licenses like crazy. KeyStarter cut our software costs by 70 percent. The fulfillment portal makes it easy to track everything.`},{name:`Pat L.`,stars:5,text:`Retired IT professional. Been in the industry 30 years. These are legitimate volume licensing keys. The pricing reflects real Microsoft partner discounts. Very impressed.`},{name:`Megan R.`,stars:4,text:`Bought Win 11 Home for my personal laptop. Everything works great. Only reason I am not giving 5 stars is the checkout process felt a bit basic. Still, great product for the price.`},{name:`Jorge A.`,stars:5,text:`International customer from Brazil. The English site was easy to navigate. Key worked in Portuguese Windows no problem. Delivery to my email was instant. Muito bom.`},{name:`Heather K.`,stars:5,text:`Home school mom with 3 kids and 3 computers. I cannot afford retail prices. KeyStarter is a blessing. All three Windows keys were under 60 total. Kids are happy, I am happier.`},{name:`Derek W.`,stars:5,text:`Wanted to try Windows 11 before committing. At 18 it was a no brainer. Ended up loving it and buying Office too. The bundle pricing would be nice but even separate it is cheap.`},{name:`Catherine S.`,stars:5,text:`Ordered Office 2021 Pro Plus for my real estate business. Need reliable software for contracts and spreadsheets. This delivers. No crashes, no activation popups, just works.`}],Ma=[`windows-11-pro`,`windows-10-pro`,`windows-11-home`,`windows-10-home`,`office-2019-pro-plus`,`office-2021-pro-plus`],Na={"windows-11-pro":199,"windows-10-pro":149,"windows-11-home":139,"windows-10-home":139,"office-2019-pro-plus":439,"office-2021-pro-plus":439},Pa={"windows-11-home":`/assets/images/box-win11-home.jpg`,"windows-11-home-official":`/assets/images/box-win11-home.jpg`,"windows-11-pro":`/assets/images/box-win11-pro.jpg`,"windows-11-pro-official":`/assets/images/box-win11-pro.jpg`,"windows-10-home":`/assets/images/pic-win10-home.webp`,"windows-10-home-official":`/assets/images/pic-win10-home-official.webp`,"windows-10-pro":`/assets/images/pic-win10-pro.webp`,"windows-10-pro-official":`/assets/images/pic-win10-pro.webp`,"office-2019-pro-plus":`/assets/images/box-office-2019.jpg`,"office-2021-pro-plus":`/assets/images/box-office-2021.jpg`,"win-11-iot-2024-entry":`/assets/images/box-iot-win